      "text": [
        "Testimonials",
        "“I've loved getting to know every single woman on the team at Isla Porter. Most cabinet companies have such a limited style vocabulary, which is not only completely uninspiring, but typically makes my job harder and leaves room for more errors. But in this case, the Isla Porter women immediately und",
        "Jourdan Fairchild, Jourdan Fairchild Design",
        "“As the kitchen is typically the heart of many homes we work on, we put so much design and effort into the cabinetry and millwork details. Those elements need to be of the best quality made from long-lasting materials and reflect the overall design scheme of the home. Isla Porter has created a platf",
        "Anne McDonald, Anne McDonald Design",
        "“What I love about Isla Porter is that the horizon feels wide open. On top of an elevated and varied collection of offerings, there are endless ways to introduce personalized details — a millwork piece, the ability to specify a custom color, and so on. It makes our team excited to dig in and play!”",
        "Liz Hoekzema, KLH Custom Homes",
        "“It has been such a joy to work with Isla Porter. I typically work with new vendors on personal projects, so that I can experience the quality of the product and level of service first-hand. This was the case with our first project with Isla Porter. I worked with Briauna and her team on a kitchen re",
        "Alison Giese, Alison Giese Interiors",
        "“Isla Porter’s aesthetic is unmistakable—tailored, historically informed, and quietly bold. But what stood out most was the heft of the cabinets: substantial, finely finished, and clearly built to last. Their design team meets you where you are being as technical or full service as you desire; they ",
        "Colin Wiencek, Homeowner"
      ]
    },
